{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/RelayTransport","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/CustomTransports","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/SecretsAndTokens","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackTransport","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/GitHubDirectTransport"],"title":"Transports","generated":true,"anchor":"Transports"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RelayTransport"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A relay holds the GitHub credential server-side, so the app binary never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ships a writable token. This is the recommended production path (see the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“Secrets” discussion in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/SecretsAndTokens"},{"type":"text","text":"): the relay verifies an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optional CAPTCHA, enforces rate limits and payload caps, formats the issue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"body, creates the issue with its server-held credential, and returns the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issue number."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RelayTransport"},{"type":"text","text":" is wire-compatible with the same relays the Love Letter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Web and Android SDKs target — it speaks the canonical browser⇄relay HTTP"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contract."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let transport = RelayTransport(","    endpoint: URL(string: \"https:\/\/your-relay.example.com\/api\/feedback\")!",")","let feedback = FeedbackClient(appName: \"AcmeApp\", transport: transport)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The transport sends a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST <endpoint>"},{"type":"text","text":" request with a JSON body matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relay contract ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"type"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"title"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":", optional "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"contactEmail"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"extraFields","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"deviceInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", optional ","type":"text"},{"code":"captchaToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). On success it decodes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"{ \"issueNumber\": Int, \"issueUrl\": String }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" response and returns the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issue number.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"CAPTCHA tokens are fetched per submission","level":2,"anchor":"CAPTCHA-tokens-are-fetched-per-submission"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CAPTCHA tokens (Cloudflare Turnstile \/ hCaptcha) are single-use and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"short-lived (typically ~120–300s). A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FeedbackClient"},{"type":"text","text":" — and therefore the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transport it holds — is built once at app start and kept for the process"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lifetime, so a token captured at construction time would always be stale or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already consumed by the time "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"submit"},{"type":"text","text":" runs. For that reason the transport"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"captchaTokenProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" closure that is invoked "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"on every"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"submit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", yielding a fresh token each time:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let transport = RelayTransport(","    endpoint: URL(string: \"https:\/\/your-relay.example.com\/api\/feedback\")!,","    captchaTokenProvider: { await captcha.freshToken() }  \/\/ fresh per submit",")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This mirrors the per-submission ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getCaptchaToken"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"captchaTokenProvider"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contract of the Love Letter Web and Android SDKs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Attachments are ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"text":" sent by this transport. The relay contract","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries them, but the Apple SDK’s attachment-upload path currently targets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/GitHubDirectTransport","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" only; relay attachment support is tracked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"separately.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackTransport"},{"type":"text","text":" that posts reports to an "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"adopter-operated relay","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead of to GitHub directly."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore"]]},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RelayTransport"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"LoveLetterCore"}],"title":"RelayTransport","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RelayTransport","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14LoveLetterCore14RelayTransportV","symbolKind":"struct"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/RelayTransport\/init(endpoint:captchaToken:session:)","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/RelayTransport\/init(endpoint:captchaTokenProvider:session:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/RelayTransport\/captchaTokenProvider","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/RelayTransport\/endpoint","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/RelayTransport\/session"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/RelayTransport\/submit(_:deviceInfo:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/lovelettercore\/relaytransport"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/documentation\/LoveLetterCore\/FeedbackTransport","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/LoveLetterCore\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","ki